      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a solid template. it feels professional but not too cold. \n\none thing though—our company culture is a bit more laid back and \"scrappy,\" so the template feels a little stiff. can u give me a version that's a bit more personable and warm? i want the candidate to feel like we actually liked them as people, even if they didn't get the job. just don't make it unprofessional or weird lol.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
